nts.","summary":"Route Mobile appoints new CEO with telecom sales expertise. Q3 revenue slightly down YoY due to ILD business decline.\nGross profit margin up 340 bps YoY with a shift to higher-margin segments; steady PAT margins amid ongoing investments.","url":"https://sqst.in/8UdnR","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-17T12:42:47","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"501298","title":"Route Mobile Ltd shared its Q3 FY26 earnings call transcript, highlighting a leadership change with Tushar Agnihotri assuming the CEO role. The transition aims to enhance execution and growth focus.\nThe company reported improved gross margins at 24.5% due to a strategic shift to higher-margin domestic and regional businesses, despite a slight revenue decline from lower-margin international messaging.","summary":"Route Mobile Ltd shared its Q3 FY26 earnings call transcript, highlighting a leadership change with Tushar Agnihotri assuming the CEO role. The transition aims to enhance execution and growth focus.\nThe company reported improved gross margins at 24.5% due to a strategic shift to higher-margin domestic and regional businesses, despite a slight revenue decline from lower-margin international messaging.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=55145c84-0111-48d3-8974-a62187833c8e.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-17T12:41:21","source":"BSE"},{"id":"808751487333940224","title":"Route Mobile reported Q3 & 9M FY25-26 revenue of 44,523 mn, EBITDA 5,237 mn LTM.\nBoard announced Rs.3/share interim dividend; focus remains on WhatsApp solutions and global clients.","summary":"Route Mobile reported Q3 & 9M FY25-26 revenue of 44,523 mn, EBITDA 5,237 mn LTM.\nBoard announced Rs.3/share interim dividend; focus remains on WhatsApp solutions and global clients.","url":"https://sqst.in/kQcHG","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-09T22:59:40","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"808750614918708352","title":"Route Mobile's Q3FY26 revenue dipped to ₹1107.06 cr from ₹1183.79 cr YoY.